          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2002 年厦门大学细胞生物学考研试题"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.13,
            0.418,
            0.145
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "一、填空题（每空1分，共24分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.148,
            0.849,
            0.459
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.148,
                0.794,
                0.163
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. 用流式细胞仪分选细胞时，是用标记细胞，结果将标记细胞与非标记细胞分开。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.167,
                0.487,
                0.181
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 蛋白聚糖是一种由和组成的巨大分子。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.186,
                0.749,
                0.2
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 真核细胞内 rRNA 前体在加工过程中是以形式存在的，最后被加工形成。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.204,
                0.756,
                0.219
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 蛋白质的 N-连接糖基化反应发生在中，在多肽链上糖基化修饰的信号是。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.222,
                0.848,
                0.256
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5. 在粘合斑的跨膜连接处，胞外基质粘连蛋白通过跨膜整合蛋白（integrin）和共处细胞内蛋白和蛋白。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.26,
                0.849,
                0.293
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6. 是能够促进与之相连锁的基因转录活性的调控序列，这种作用是通过结合或影响而实现的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.297,
                0.733,
                0.312
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7. 高尔基体形成的分泌泡可分为两类，一类通过途径，另一类通过途径。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.315,
                0.709,
                0.33
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "8. 神经节苷脂（ganglioside）由于含有成分，所以属于糖脂，带负电。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.334,
                0.767,
                0.348
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "9. 生物膜中，疏水的碳氢链最常见的是取构象；而不饱和碳氢链则几乎全是。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.353,
                0.568,
                0.385
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "10. 最重要的人工细胞周期同步化方法包括阻断法和阻断法。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.389,
                0.697,
                0.423
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "11. 根据细胞繁殖状况，可将机体内所有细胞相对地分为三类:细胞、细胞和细胞。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.426,
                0.848,
                0.459
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "12. 原核与真核细胞中, 已发现上百种 DNA 结合蛋白具有结构模式, 该模式由一伸展短肽连接两个 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\alpha"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 螺旋构成。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.464,
            0.435,
            0.479
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "二、选择题（每小题1分，共10分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.482,
            0.609,
            0.497
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 动物体内各种类型的细胞中, 具有最高全能性的细胞是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.501,
            0.528,
            0.515
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A、体细胞 B、生殖细胞 C、受精卵 D、干细胞"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.52,
            0.414,
            0.534
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 类囊体膜中主要的外在蛋白是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.538,
            0.498,
            0.552
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A、CF1 B、细胞色素 f C、CF0 D、质体蓝素"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.556,
            0.506,
            0.571
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 有丝分裂中期染色体的唯一染色质组分是"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.575,
            0.634,
            0.59
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A、常染色体 B、异染色体 C、活性染色体 D、非活性染色体"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.593,
            0.647,
            0.608
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. 有丝分裂过程中, 使用下列哪种药物可以抑制纺锤体的形成?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.612,
            0.58,
            0.627
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A、秋水仙素 B、紫杉醇 C、羟基脲 D、细胞松弛素 B"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.631,
            0.609,
            0.645
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. 在四种核小体组蛋白中, 已知进化上最为保守的两种是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.649,
            0.612,
            0.663
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A、H3 和 H2A B、H4 和 H2B C、H3 和 H4 D、H2A 和 H2B"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.667,
            0.637,
            0.682
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. 被膜小泡（coated vesicle）中的网格蛋白（clathtin）是一种:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 28,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.686,
            0.598,
            0.701
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A、内在蛋白 B、外在蛋白 C、血影蛋白 D、血型糖蛋白"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 29,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.705,
            0.373,
            0.719
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. 在正常细胞中，原癌基因"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 30,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.723,
            0.668,
            0.738
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A、不表达 B、激活后表达 C、不受控制地表达 D、有控制地表达"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 31,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.742,
            0.344,
            0.757
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. 磷脂酰胆碱的英文名:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 32,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.761,
            0.494,
            0.776
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A、phosphatidylinositol B、phosphatidylserine"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 33,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.78,
            0.545,
            0.794
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "C、phosphatidylethanolamine D、phosphatidyleholine"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 34,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.798,
            0.451,
            0.812
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. 粹通 X-100（Triton X-100）是一种:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 35,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.816,
            0.634,
            0.83
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A、非离子去污剂 B、阴离子去污剂 C、有机溶剂 D、促溶剂"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 36,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.834,
            0.822,
            0.849
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. 根据多级螺旋模型，从 DNA 染色体经过四级螺旋包装形成的染色体结构共压缩了:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 37,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.853,
            0.528,
            0.868
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A、8000倍 B、8400倍 C、7400倍 D、7000倍"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 38,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.871,
            0.435,
            0.886
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "三、是非题（每小题1分，共6分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 39,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.89,
            0.786,
            0.905
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 在种子萌发过程中，乙醛酸循环体参与完成将脂肪酸转化为糖的重要生理功能。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
